@base = http://localhost:5080/api

### 작업지시 생성
POST {{base}}/work-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "plantCd": "KR01", "itemCd": "SEDAN-A", "planQty": 10, "planDate": "2026-10-29" }

### 목록
GET {{base}}/work-orders?plantCd=KR01

### 릴리즈
POST {{base}}/work-orders/1/release

### 작업 시작
POST {{base}}/work-orders/1/start

### 실적 보고 (양품 6, 불량 1)
POST {{base}}/production-results
Content-Type: application/json

{ "woId": 1, "procCd": "INSP", "eqpCd": "EQ-INSP-01", "goodQty": 6, "defectQty": 1, "defectCd": "D01",
  "reportedAt": "2026-10-29T23:30:00+09:00" }

### 실적 보고 (계획 수량 도달 → 자동 완료)
POST {{base}}/production-results
Content-Type: application/json

{ "woId": 1, "procCd": "INSP", "eqpCd": "EQ-INSP-01", "goodQty": 4, "defectQty": 0 }

### LOT 목록
GET {{base}}/work-orders/1/lots

### 실적 이력
GET {{base}}/work-orders/1/results
